abstract: >-
  GROOVE is an online regulator for VLA jerk reduction. It reduces
  within-chunk and chunk-boundary jerk in vision-language-action policy
  execution without retraining or additional VLA inference.
keywords:
  - VLA jerk
  - VLA jerk reduction
  - vision-language-action
  - action chunking
  - trajectory smoothing
  - robot manipulation
